  "term": "abstinence",
  "definition": "In this packet, abstinence refers to avoiding sexual activity for several days before and after the estimated time of ovulation as part of a natural family planning method. The fertile phase is identified using bodily signs such as hormone levels, cervical mucus changes, and basal body temperature.",
